  "pairs": [
    {
      "page_number": 1,
      "page_code": "P01",
      "title": "电力领域数据基础设施总体架构",
      "page_script": "Create a polished, high-end enterprise architecture infographic for a Chinese power-industry data infrastructure platform. Use a 2:1 horizontal canvas (2048 × 1024), deep navy and electric cyan accents on a clean warm-white background, restrained premium vector style, sharp Chinese typography, thin precise connector lines, very subtle abstract power-grid background only. This is one integrated architecture diagram: all meaningful text must live physically inside architecture layers, guard rails, endpoint nodes, or along the process connector. The text itself is the diagram.\n\nComposition: a large central platform occupies most of the canvas. Build a vertical stack of five broad, connected horizontal capability layers in the middle, with clear ascending structure and one unified platform silhouette. Put the following Chinese labels inside the corresponding layers, keeping every phrase legible and visually embedded:\n\nTop layer: “可信连接与主体接入” with “可信身份｜主体接入｜业务请求”.\nSecond layer: “运营与交易管理” with “订单合同｜授权计量｜账单结算”.\nThird layer: “服务交付与场景编排” with “接口调用｜数据沙箱｜模型任务”.\nFourth layer: “资源与产品管理” with “登记编目｜质量版本｜可订购产品”.\nBottom layer: “数据与人工智能基础” with “存储计算｜知识库｜模型服务”.\n\nAcross the core stack, use a single prominent thin cyan process connector with labeled arrow segments: “经授权资源 → 可订购产品 → 受控服务 → 计量留痕”. The arrow must visibly connect the resource/product, service delivery, and operation layers. Add a small central junction label “权利核查与授权规则” that visibly links resource management, service delivery, and operation management.\n\nCreate two separate narrow vertical guard rails running alongside the entire five-layer stack. On the left, label “安全与合规” and embed “分类分级｜权利核查｜访问控制｜输出管理｜审计追溯”. On the right, label “标准与运维” and embed “目录接口｜质量服务等级｜版本监控｜容灾处置”. They must clearly cover all five layers rather than appear as a separate bottom section.\n\nFrom the top trusted-connection layer, draw four distinct connector lines to compact external endpoint nodes around the platform. Place the endpoint text inside the nodes: “统一环境：公共能力”, “源端服务：合作伙伴资源”, “专属实例：客户专属能力”, and “受控计算：多方敏感数据联合分析”. The endpoints should sit around the central platform as connected environments, never as an independent deployment block.\n\nAt the very top of the diagram, use only one compact in-diagram conclusion label: “可信连接组织资源产品化与受控服务”. No separate explanatory paragraphs. No left text column. No right-side photo or illustration panel. No photo collage, people, cards filled with body copy, detached captions, independent bottom strip, logos, slide title, subtitle, or page number. Use only small abstract vector icons within the corresponding nodes where helpful. The central architecture diagram must occupy the visual focus and communicate the complete story without any detached text area.\n",
      "image_text_truth": {
        "script_text": "**平台定位：电力数据基础设施将经授权的数据、知识、模型与专业能力组织为可交付产品，并在不同主体和环境之间提供受控服务。**\n\n  **可信连接为多主体接入建立边界：** 平台面向机构、人员和应用建立可信身份，承接外部主体接入与业务请求。公共能力集中部署于统一环境；合作伙伴资源经可信连接器在源端提供服务；客户专属知识库、模型和场景应用配置专属实例或部署于客户指定环境；涉及多方敏感数据的业务，经受控计算环境开展联合分析。\n\n  **资源产品化明确服务供给对象：** 数据与人工智能基础能力承载经授权数据与模型，提供存储计算、知识库、向量检索、模型服务与算力资源管理。资源与产品管理将数据、知识、模型、算法和专业能力纳入登记、编目、质量与版本管理，并封装形成可订购数据产品。\n\n  **授权使用把产品管理连接到受控交付：** 平台在运营与交易管理中统一管理客户、产品规格、订单、合同、授权、计量、账单与结算；服务交付与场景编排支撑接口调用、成果交付、模型任务、数据沙箱与多方协同交付。权利核查、授权规则、交付证据和计量记录共同支持从产品订购到服务使用的可追溯过程。\n\n  **贯穿保障维持平台的持续可用与可控：** 安全与合规覆盖分类分级、权利核查、访问控制、输出管理和审计追溯全过程；标准与运维统一目录、接口、质量、服务等级和计量标准，并开展版本、监控、容灾和故障处置管理。",
        "scope": "typo_and_gibberish_only"
      },
